  "article": [
    { "en": "Last Christmas, the circus owner, Jimmy Gates, decided to take some presents to the children in hospital.", "zh": "去年圣诞节，马戏团老板吉米·盖茨决定给医院的孩子们送些礼物。" },
    { "en": "He dressed up as Father Christmas and rode through the streets on an elephant called Jumbo.", "zh": "他打扮成圣诞老人，骑着一头名叫江伯的大象穿过街道。" },
    { "en": "When the police saw them, they told Jimmy that he must not take the elephant into the main streets.", "zh": "警察看见他们后，告诉吉米不能让大象上主要街道。" },
